---
/**
 * TTS output, grouped by pipeline stage.
 *
 * Structurally this mirrors the cloning studio's Results.astro -- numbered stage
 * blocks, figures that expand to fullscreen, a waveform with a real transport --
 * because the two pages are the same project and should not feel like two projects.
 * The differences are only the ones the model actually imposes: two stages rather
 * than three, and nothing to pair an "original" against, since there is no reference
 * audio in a text-to-speech pipeline.
 */
const expandIcon =
  '<svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 3H3v6M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M15 21h6v-6"/></svg>';
---
<section class="results" id="results" data-tts-results hidden>
  <div class="shell">
    <header class="head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Output</p>
      <h2>What came back.</h2>
      <p class="intro">
        Stage by stage, drawn in your browser from the arrays the server sends.
        Click any plot to enlarge it.
      </p>
    </header>

    <p class="truncated" data-tts-truncated hidden>
      <b>The decoder ran to its step ceiling</b> (<span data-tts-steps></span> steps)
      without the stop token firing, so the tail of this clip is artefact rather than
      speech. It is a quirk of the checkpoint, not of your text &mdash; you can see it
      in the alignment plot as a diagonal that runs flat into the right-hand edge.
    </p>

    <!-- ============================================== stage 01: synthesizer -->
    <section class="stage-block">
      <header class="stage-head">
        <p class="stage-n">01</p>
        <div>
          <h3>Synthesizer</h3>
          <p>Tacotron2 decodes the text into 80 mel bands over time, attending to
             characters as it goes. Both plots come from the same forward pass.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <div class="pair">
        <figure>
          <figcaption>
            Mel spectrogram
            <button class="expand" type="button" data-expand="mel" data-expand-title="mel spectrogram"
                    aria-label="View mel spectrogram full screen" set:html={expandIcon} />
          </figcaption>
          <canvas data-tts-plot="mel" height="280" role="img"
                  aria-label="Mel spectrogram of the synthesised audio"></canvas>
        </figure>
        <figure>
          <figcaption>
            Attention alignment
            <button class="expand" type="button" data-expand="alignment" data-expand-title="attention alignment"
                    aria-label="View attention alignment full screen" set:html={expandIcon} />
          </figcaption>
          <canvas data-tts-plot="alignment" height="280" role="img"
                  aria-label="Attention alignment matrix"></canvas>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <p class="note">
        A clean diagonal in the alignment means the model tracked the text and stopped
        where the words did; one that runs flat into the right-hand edge means it never
        found the end.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- ================================================= stage 02: vocoder -->
    <section class="stage-block">
      <header class="stage-head">
        <p class="stage-n">02</p>
        <div>
          <h3>Vocoder</h3>
          <p>HiFi-GAN turns the spectrogram back into pressure over time, in a single
             pass rather than sample by sample. Click the plot to seek.</p>
        </div>
      </header>

      <figure class="full">
        <figcaption>
          Synthesised audio
          <span class="who" data-player-name="tts"></span>
          <button class="expand" type="button" data-expand="wave-tts" data-expand-title="waveform"
                  aria-label="View waveform full screen" set:html={expandIcon} />
        </figcaption>
        <canvas data-wave="tts" height="220" role="img"
                aria-label="Waveform of the synthesised audio"></canvas>
        <div class="transport">
          <button type="button" data-play="tts" aria-label="Play synthesised audio">
            <svg class="i-play" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 5.2v13.6L19 12z"/></svg>
            <svg class="i-pause" width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 5h3.2v14H7zM13.8 5H17v14h-3.2z"/></svg>
          </button>
          <p class="time"><span data-time="tts">0:00</span> / <span data-dur="tts">0:00</span></p>
          <a class="dl" data-download="tts" download hidden>Download</a>
        </div>
        <audio data-audio="tts" preload="metadata"></audio>
      </figure>
    </section>

    <dialog class="zoom" data-zoom aria-label="Enlarged plot">
      <div class="zoom-bar">
        <p class="zoom-title" data-zoom-title></p>
        <button class="zoom-close" type="button" data-zoom-close aria-label="Close enlarged view">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M6 6l12 12M18 6L6 18"/></svg>
        </button>
      </div>
      <canvas data-zoom-canvas role="img" aria-label="Enlarged plot"></canvas>
      <p class="zoom-hint">Press <kbd>Esc</kbd> or click outside to close</p>
    </dialog>

    <div class="timings">
      <p class="eyebrow">Server timings</p>
      <ul data-tts-timings></ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .results { padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem) clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem); scroll-margin-top: 4rem; }
  .head { max-width: 60ch; margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem); }
  h2 { font-size: var(--step-3); margin-block: 0.4em 0.5em; }
  .intro { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step--1); }

  .truncated {
    margin-bottom: 1.4rem;
    padding: 0.7rem 0.9rem;
    font-size: var(--step--1);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--warn);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--warn) 9%, transparent);
    border-left: 2px solid var(--warn);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
    max-width: 72ch;
  }
  .truncated b { font-weight: 500; }

  .stage-block { margin-bottom: clamp(2.2rem, 4vw, 3.4rem); }

  .stage-head {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
    gap: 0.4rem 1rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding-bottom: 0.9rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  @media (min-width: 46rem) {
    .stage-head { align-items: center; }
  }
  .stage-n {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent);
    border: 1px solid var(--accent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    width: 2rem; height: 2rem;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
  }
  .stage-head h3 { font-size: var(--step-2); }
  .stage-head p { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step--1); margin-top: 0.3rem; max-width: 62ch; }

  .pair { display: grid; gap: 1px; background: var(--rule); border: 1px solid var(--rule); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; }
  @media (min-width: 52rem) { .pair { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

  figure { background: var(--paper); margin: 0; padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.2rem; }
  figcaption {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
    display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 0.5rem; flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .who { color: var(--ink-faint); font-size: 0.68rem; }

  .full {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }
  .note { color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: var(--step--1); margin-top: 0.9rem; max-width: 70ch; }

  canvas {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    background: var(--viz-bg);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }
  .pair [data-tts-plot] { height: 280px; }
  [data-wave] { height: 200px; cursor: pointer; }
  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .pair [data-tts-plot] { height: 230px; }
  }

  .expand {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    width: 22px; height: 22px; padding: 0;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    cursor: pointer;
    flex: none;
    transition: border-color 0.18s var(--ease), color 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .expand:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }

  /* --- fullscreen plot --------------------------------------------------- */
  .zoom {
    width: min(96vw, 1600px);
    height: min(92vh, 1000px);
    padding: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .zoom::backdrop { background: rgb(0 0 0 / 0.62); backdrop-filter: blur(3px); }
  .zoom[open] { display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto 1fr auto; }

  .zoom-bar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem 0.8rem 1.2rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .zoom-title {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.76rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em; color: var(--ink-soft); margin: 0;
  }
  .zoom-close {
    margin-left: auto;
    display: grid; place-items: center;
    width: 30px; height: 30px; padding: 0;
    background: transparent; border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius); color: var(--ink-soft); cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .zoom-close:hover { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); }
  .zoom canvas { width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 0; }
  .zoom-hint {
    padding: 0.55rem 1.2rem 0.75rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.66rem; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 0;
  }
  kbd {
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.9em;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule-strong); border-bottom-width: 2px;
    border-radius: 3px; padding: 0.05em 0.3em;
  }

  /* --- transport ---------------------------------------------------------- */
  .transport { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.8rem; margin-top: 0.7rem; }
  .transport button {
    width: 30px; height: 30px; display: grid; place-items: center;
    background: var(--ink); color: var(--paper);
    border: 0; border-radius: 50%; cursor: pointer; flex: none;
    transition: background 0.18s var(--ease);
  }
  .transport button:hover { background: var(--accent); }
  .transport button svg { grid-area: 1 / 1; }
  .transport button .i-pause { display: none; }
  .transport button[data-playing] .i-play { display: none; }
  .transport button[data-playing] .i-pause { display: block; }
  .time { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--ink-faint); margin: 0; }
  .dl {
    margin-left: auto; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.05em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--ink-faint);
  }
  .dl:hover { color: var(--accent); }
  /* The <audio> element only plays; the canvas and transport above are the UI. */
  audio { display: none; }

  .timings { margin-top: 1.8rem; }
  /* Injected via innerHTML at runtime, so Astro's scoping attribute never reaches
     these nodes -- they must be addressed globally or they render unstyled. */
  .timings :global(ul) {
    list-style: none; margin: 0.7rem 0 0; padding: 0;
    display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1px;
    background: var(--rule); border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden;
  }
  .timings :global(li) {
    background: var(--paper); padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem; flex: 1 1 7rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.72rem;
  }
  .timings :global(li b) {
    display: block; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.64rem; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }
  .timings :global(li span) { color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.9rem; }
  .timings :global(li[data-total] span) { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
